<section class="current-files" aria-labelledby="republic-now"><div class="section-kicker">Follow the consequences</div><h2 id="republic-now">The Republic Now</h2><p class="section-intro-copy">Four active constitutional files. These editorial briefings summarize published records; each carries its own date.</p><div class="briefing-grid">{% for file in currentFiles %}<article class="briefing"><span class="meta">As of {{ file.asOf | worldDateLabel }}</span><h3><a href="dossier-{{ file.id }}.html">{{ file.title }}</a></h3><p>{{ file.summary }}</p><a class="text-link" href="dossier-{{ file.id }}.html">Follow this file →</a></article>{% endfor %}</div></section>